1
00:00:00,004 --> 00:00:03,202
The hardest moment on shift is
not always clinical.

2
00:00:03,202 --> 00:00:06,045
Sometimes, it is the next
sentence you say.

3
00:00:06,095 --> 00:00:09,104
This is Carecraft. One useful
minute of practice,

4
00:00:09,104 --> 00:00:09,856
every day.

5
00:00:09,906 --> 00:00:14,116
Every day, one short scenario from real
working life is waiting for

6
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:14,466
you.

7
00:00:14,578 --> 00:00:18,413
Choose your words, and see why the
strongest answer works.

8
00:00:18,413 --> 00:00:19,947
Specific, kind, and actionable.

9
00:00:19,997 --> 00:00:23,132
Thirty short lessons cover
communication, safety,

10
00:00:23,132 --> 00:00:24,176
and teamwork.

11
00:00:24,226 --> 00:00:26,967
Each lesson moves from idea, to scenario,

12
00:00:26,967 --> 00:00:28,533
to practice, to reflection.

13
00:00:28,583 --> 00:00:32,615
Prefer to watch? Learn it as a guided
slideshow in eight minutes.

14
00:00:32,812 --> 00:00:37,519
Thirty lessons. Ninety visual guides.
Twenty two practice activities.

15
00:00:37,569 --> 00:00:41,241
Ninety visual guides make every
idea easy to remember.

16
00:00:41,791 --> 00:00:44,558
Watch a handover come to life,

17
00:00:44,558 --> 00:00:47,326
then build your own.
Situation. Background.

18
00:00:47,326 --> 00:00:48,248
Assessment. Recommendation.

19
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:51,090
The toolkit helps you prepare
the real thing,

20
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:53,183
from handovers to huddles and debriefs.

21
00:00:53,233 --> 00:00:56,281
And your practice map shows how
your skills are growing.

22
00:00:57,437 --> 00:00:59,637
Lessons come as short slide journeys.

23
00:00:59,637 --> 00:01:02,203
Conversations that build trust
takes eight minutes,

24
00:01:02,203 --> 00:01:04,037
with checks along the way.

25
00:01:04,087 --> 00:01:08,870
Practise in animated scenes. Watch, decide
which hand hygiene moment fits,

26
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:11,044
then reflect. No time pressure.

27
00:01:11,094 --> 00:01:14,575
Build an SBAR or ISBAR
handover step by step,

28
00:01:14,575 --> 00:01:17,282
with fictional practice drafts,
never real records.

29
00:01:17,332 --> 00:01:19,846
Visual guides make tricky ideas simple,

30
00:01:19,846 --> 00:01:22,779
like reading risk numbers
without being misled.

31
00:01:22,829 --> 00:01:26,464
My Growth shows what you have
rehearsed across eight skills.

32
00:01:26,464 --> 00:01:28,281
It tracks practice, not competence.

33
00:01:28,331 --> 00:01:29,210
Open Carecraft free, and practise the
moment before it happens.

